error[DS0115]: `where` takes one condition
  --> query:1:17
  |
1 | from t | where a, b;
  |                 ^ a comma does not join conditions
  |
  = help: combine the conditions with `and`: `a and b`

error[DS0101]: expected `|` or `;`, found `,`
  --> query:2:17
  |
2 | from t | where a,;
  |                 ^

error[DS0101]: expected `|` or `;`, found `,`
  --> query:3:30
  |
3 | from t | top 5 by amount desc,;
  |                              ^

error[DS0101]: expected `|` or `;`, found `,`
  --> query:4:16
  |
4 | from t | take 5,;
  |                ^

error[DS0101]: expected `)`, found `,`
  --> query:5:34
  |
5 | from t | where a between (1 .. 10,);
  |                          -       ^
  |                          |
  |                          to close this `(`

error[DS0101]: expected `)`, found `,`
  --> query:6:23
  |
6 | from t | extend x = (a,);
  |                     - ^
  |                     |
  |                     to close this `(`

error[DS0101]: expected `]`, found `,`
  --> query:7:24
  |
7 | from t | extend x = a[0,];
  |                      - ^
  |                      |
  |                      to close this `[`

error[DS0116]: `distinct *` cannot have a trailing `,`
  --> query:8:20
  |
8 | from t | distinct *,;
  |                    ^ `*` already means every column
  |
  = help: remove the `,`

error[DS0117]: `project *` is SQL's `SELECT *`
  --> query:9:18
  |
9 | from t | project *, | take 5;
  |                  ^ `project` lists the columns to keep
  |
  = help: to keep every column and add computed ones, use `extend`

error[DS0101]: expected `)`, found `,`
   --> query:10:30
   |
10 | from t | extend x = long(null,);
   |                         -    ^
   |                         |
   |                         to close this `(`

error[DS0101]: expected `)`, found `,`
   --> query:11:30
   |
11 | from t | extend x = long(null,,);
   |                         -    ^
   |                         |
   |                         to close this `(`

error[DS0116]: `distinct *` cannot have a trailing `,`
   --> query:12:20
   |
12 | from t | distinct *,
   |                    ^ `*` already means every column
   |
   = help: remove the `,`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from t | where a and b;
    from t | where a,;
    from t | top 5 by amount desc,;
    from t | take 5,;
    from t | where a between (1 .. 10,);
    from t | extend x = (a,);
    from t | extend x = a[0,];
    from t | distinct *;
    from t | project *, | take 5;
    from t | extend x = long(null,);
    from t | extend x = long(null,,);
    from t | distinct *
